  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-icX2iame\" id=\"link-0\">概念介绍</h2><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-nQS52suM\" id=\"link-1\">第三方落地页</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZruS5mfj\">指客户自有的落地页。</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-5lQZZ8nf\" id=\"link-2\">功能介绍</h2><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-qGMmq4uS\" id=\"link-3\">获取第三方落地页站点列表</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-FU7EpedQ\">用户可以调用<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710624992256\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【获取第三方落地页站点列表】</a>接口获取第三方落地页站点列表，列表信息包含站点审核状态、站点创建时间、站点名称、站点ID、缩略图地址、站点地址。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-T7ZaFffR\" id=\"link-4\">创建第三方落地页站点</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-1yZ5YcY5\">用户可以调用<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710625533967\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【创建第三方落地页站点】</a>接口创建第三方落地页站点，接口会返回\"code_0\"，代表创建成功。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-YzO5qzZ4\" id=\"link-5\">修改第三方落地页站点</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-DiKiJyJZ\">用户可以调用<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710626095116\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【修改第三方落地页站点】</a>接口修改第三方落地页站点，接口会返回\"code_0\"，代表修改成功。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-6kLqK7Kj\" id=\"link-6\">删除第三方落地页站点</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-SJ08bION\">用户可以调用<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710626717696\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【删除第三方落地页站点】</a>接口删除第三方落地页站点，接口会返回\"code_0\"，代表删除成功。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-Gs0ptAgs\" id=\"link-7\">获取第三方落地页预览地址</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-DsPwgJfI\">用户可以调用<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710627256332\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【获取第三方落地页预览地址】</a>接口获取第三方落地页预览地址。</p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "第三方落地页管理"
}
